## G. Matching algorithm

Design the actual mathematical/algorithmic approach.

Explain:

* Inputs
* Hard constraints
* Soft constraints
* Scoring
* Team-level objective
* Candidate ranking
* How diversity is measured
* How experience balance is measured
* How preferences are handled
* How ties are resolved
* How unmatched users are handled

## H. Explainability system

Explain how the system will generate evidence-based explanations for each match.

